    {
      "id": "claim_6b606f729d484864a0823a7cb21e69a9",
      "statement": "The LangSmith agent documentation model is that a workspace contains agents, an agent’s traces are divided among the fixed Production, Staging, Development, and Local environments, and every trace records an agent and one environment; an identifier is immutable while a display name can change.",
